<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Hong Leong Properties year net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hong Leong Properties year net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 165.12   vs	 127.92</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 23.6    vs	  18.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   629.07   vs	 642.20</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   200.25   vs	 166.16</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  4.47   vs  less   1.48</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    6.59   vs  less  16.83</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	12.0    vs	   8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Hong Leong Properties Bhd is involved in the property business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
